---
title: Tzatziki Sauce
servings: 2
cuisine: greek
main_protein: dairy
prep_time: "5 minutes"
cook_time: "0 minutes"
tags:
  - side
image: ../obsidian/attachments/IMG_6375.jpeg
leftover_portions: 0
prep:
  - Deseed and finely dice the cucumber
  - Chop 0.5 cup fresh dill
  - Mince 2 garlic cloves
---

Place @english cucumber{1%cup}, deseeded and diced very small, with a sprinkle of salt in a #bowl{} and let sit for ~{10%minutes} to release any extra moisture.

Meanwhile, mix together @plain greek yogurt{2%cups}, @lemon juice{0.33%cup}, @fresh dill{0.5%cup}, chopped, @garlic{2%cloves}, minced, @salt{1%tsp} and @black pepper{0.25%tsp}.

Drain cucumber, then add it in and stir to combine. Taste and add any additional salt or pepper.
